  m_text: '

    Reards come in 2 unique types:

    Stats and Abilties each with
    a common and rare variant


    The stats upgrade will give you multiplicative
    bonus to one stat with rares giving 3x a common.


    Ability upgrades grant
    a random ability with rare upgrades being better'
